{{Stub}}'''Steamwheedle Port''' is a port [[village]] on the coast of [[Tanaris Desert]], first built to receive materials for the construction of [[Gadgetzan]]. The port is directly connected to [[Undermine]], but at this point in the game it is not scheduled for any passenger ships to dock.

